This product is an independent re-implementation. It reproduces the
observable behavior, command-line option scheme, and the file and tag
formats of mp3gain in order to remain compatible with it. It does NOT
contain or derive from any of mp3gain's original source code.

- Loudness analysis is based on the publicly documented ReplayGain
  specification. Filter coefficient values are public standard numbers
  shared across independent implementations and are not copyrightable.

- ffmpeg is NOT bundled. It is invoked as an external process located on
  the user's PATH; users must install it separately.

- The graphical interface uses PySide6 (Qt for Python), which is licensed
  under the GNU LGPL v3. It is linked dynamically so that users may
  replace the Qt libraries. When distributing pre-built binaries, the
